{{!< default}}
{{!--
    Region page — /commentarii-mundi/ukraine/mykolaiv/

    The deepest level of World → Conflict → Region → Event. Rendered by a
    routes.yaml channel:

      /commentarii-mundi/ukraine/mykolaiv/:
        controller: channel
        template: cm-region
        data: tag.mykolaiv
        filter: tag:hash-commentarii-mundi+tag:ukraine

    A channel, deliberately: the conflict level is a collection and owns these posts'
    permalinks. A region collection would steal them from their parent conflict, and
    a post can belong to only one collection. Channels own no permalinks, so the
    region level can be added for any region at any time without moving a post.

    Because the region route is explicit, it wins over the conflict collection's
    /commentarii-mundi/ukraine/{slug}/ permalink pattern — so a region slug must not
    collide with a report slug.

    The breadcrumb shows Historia Arcana → Commentarii Mundi → Region. To insert the
    conflict level, copy this file per conflict (cm-region-ukraine.hbs) and pass
    conflictName/conflictUrl to the breadcrumb partial — Ghost gives a channel no way
    to know its parent route.
--}}

{{!-- Master switch: the CM layout renders only while the page with slug
     "commentarii-mundi" is published. Otherwise this route falls back to Source's
     ordinary archive (see docs/commentarii-mundi.md §2). --}}
{{#get "pages" filter="slug:commentarii-mundi" fields="id" limit="1" as |cmHome|}}
    {{#if cmHome}}
        {{> "commentarii-mundi/page-region" ../this}}
    {{else}}
        {{> "commentarii-mundi/archive-fallback" ../this}}
    {{/if}}
{{/get}}
